      "content": "It's crucial to seek advice from a healthcare professional before taking any medication, especially since you're experiencing some health conditions like asthma. Propranolol can help reduce anxiety, but it can also affect your asthma. Proper guidance will ensure it's safe and appropriate for you to use it in this situation. Consider practicing relaxation techniques or consulting a doctor for advice tailored to your needs.",
